\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Poltergeist_Male_Addon_3_19d112.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Poltergeist Female Addon 3\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Poltergeist_Female_Addon_3_48208e.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Base_Outfits\">Base Outfits</span></h2>\n<p>Finish the <a href=\"#/quest/feaster-of-souls-quest\">Feaster of Souls Quest</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"w-First_Addon_.28Cape.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-First_Addon_(Cape)\">First Addon (Cape)</span></h2>\n<p>Use a <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Spooky%20Hood\"><img alt=\"Spooky Hood\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Spooky_Hood_3ab415.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Spooky%20Hood\">Spooky Hood</a>.\n</p><p><span class=\"sounds tibiatext tibiaorange\">The spooky hood is yours!</span>\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Poltergeist Male Addon 1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Poltergeist_Male_Addon_1_e1588a.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Poltergeist Female Addon 1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Poltergeist_Female_Addon_1_8522cf.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"w-Second_Addon_.28Eyes_and_Shoulder_Pad.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Second_Addon_(Eyes_and_Shoulder_Pad)\">Second Addon (Eyes and Shoulder Pad)</span></h2>\n<p>Use a <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ghost%20Claw\"><img alt=\"Ghost Claw\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ghost_Claw_d7effb.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Ghost%20Claw\">Ghost Claw</a>.\n</p><p><span class=\"sounds tibiatext tibiaorange\">You can use the ghost claw now!</span>\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Poltergeist Male Addon 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Poltergeist_Male_Addon_2_98a53c.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Poltergeist Female Addon 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Poltergeist_Female_Addon_2_8feae8.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>","quests":["feaster-of-souls-quest"]}